    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Hornacis Sea of Flowers] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Map Introduction: </> Blooming flowers and trees stretch along the lake shore, complementing the mountains. This is the most beloved destination for people in love. When you look down at this grassland from a high altitude, you can see a heart-shaped road. \n<Assistant_Title2> [Order World]: </>\n<Assistant_Title3> ① Old Dreams of the Original Work: </>\n{JumpToUI: Footprint Tracking | 1301927 } \n <Assistant_Title3> ② World Gameplay: </>\n{JumpToUI: Worm of Time Treasure | 1301933 } {JumpToUI: spirit body threads | 1301930 } {JumpToUI: Bard | 1301928 } {JumpToUI: Storm Chasing | 1301934 } {JumpToUI: Fashion Salon | 1301937 } {JumpToUI: Mysterious Treasure Chest | 1301931 } {JumpToUI: Object of Phenomenon | 1301931 } {JumpToUI: Extraordinary Roleplay | 1301977 } \n <Assistant_Title2> [Era Quests]: </> \n {JumpToUI: Life in the Era | 1302439 } {JumpToUI: Anecdotes of the Era | 1302440 } {JumpToUI: Acting Story | 1302441 }"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Цветочное море Хонакис】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Введение в карту: </>Цветущие цветы и деревья тянутся вдоль берега озера, контрастируя с горами. Это излюбленное место влюбленных людей. Если посмотреть на этот луг с большой высоты, можно увидеть дорогу в форме сердца. \n<Assistant_Title2>【Мир порядка】: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>①Original Old Dream: </>\n{JumpToUI: Footprint Pursuit|1301927}\n<Assistant_Title3>②Мировой игровой процесс: </>\n{JumpToUI: Time Bug Сокровище|1301933} {JumpToUI:Spiritual Thread|1301930} {JumpToUI:Бард|1301928} {JumpToUI:Storm Chase|1301934} {JumpToUI:Салон моды|1301937} {JumpToUI:Изменить сундук с сокровищами|1301931} {JumpToUI: Visionary Object|1301931} {JumpToUI:Extraordinary Acting|1301977}\n<Assistant_Title2>【Era Tasks】:</>\n{JumpToUI:Editions|1302439} {JumpToUI:Анекдоты той эпохи|1302440} {JumpToUI:Acting Истории|1302441}",
